ps_function_prediction.instruction:
For BAR {}, use the provided reference harmony spans with local keys to predict the primary and secondary harmonic functions for each span. Each reference item includes the local key that applies to that span. Functions must include alteration when present, such as bVI or #IV. Use case-insensitive function labels; chord quality is predicted separately. Use none when there is no secondary function. Return a JSON list with one item per span id.

